WEBVTT

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers who travel the world,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.810
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.300
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.070
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.920
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.560
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:58.240
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.020
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.680
With you guys

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.820
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.260
If we join forces

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.260
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:15.860
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:23.440
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:28.940
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.020
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:37.020
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:42.260
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.260
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.260
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:53.120
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.080
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.020
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.080
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.510
The Cooking Fest entered into its third round.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:15.460
Komatsu partnered up with Toriko for the

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:19.430
Whole Island Cooking event,
and passed brilliantly with Oyster Isle.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:25.760
However, in the final tournament, he's slated to have a showdown with Zaus,

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.030
the Cooking King, who's won 14 times before!

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:30.390
Meanwhile,

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:34.270
suspicious wriggling forms close in on the stadium!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:44.440
The Outbreak of War!
 Gourmet Corp.'s Fierce Full-scale Offensive!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.020
Sounds like somethin's here...

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.750
At last...

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:59.460
The 50th Cooking Festival.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.150
I give you the 16 very delicious chefs

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:06.640
who are going to compete in the final tournament!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.500
I ain't gonna let 'em interfere with the Fest!

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.200
That's Chef Komatsu!

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.270
Don't tell me he's made it as far as the final tournament?!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.390
I don't believe it myself...

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:07.250
I thought I might lose at any of the stages, but here I am.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:11.360
All I can do is battle with all my heart for the next one too.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.930
<b>Long time no see, Koma-chan!</b>

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:17.600
Ume-chan!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.830
Ume-chan! Ume-chan! Ume-chan!

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:25.900
What the heck?!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.980
<b>You should've told me you were here before!</b>

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.770
Sorry. I didn't have a chance...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.790
But you're doing great, Koma-chan!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.350
Congratulations on making it to the final tournament!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.500
Thank you!

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.500
It feels like a dream, for a guy like me to be

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.590
<b>up on such a grand stage...</b>

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.270
It's your talent!

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.590
You don't play second fiddle to anyone!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:48.430
<b>You even have a chance at winning!</b>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.630
Oh, come on...

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:56.300
Somewhere along the line, you moved way beyond me as a chef.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.740
I'm totally proud of you!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.290
Ume-chan...

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.350
Koma-chan?

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:09.560
Sorry...

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.370
Huh? I wonder why...

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:16.640
Up to now, every day has been a whirlwind,

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:20.040
with me desperately trying to get a grip on it,

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:23.210
but seeing your face has

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.210
<b>suddenly filled me with relief, Ume-chan.</b>

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.390
Koma-chan...

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.970
Getting in the rankings

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.830
takes extraordinary achievements.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.310
I can imagine how hard it's been for you.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:49.630
Speakings of rankings, until just recently,

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.260
<b>Take-chan was ranked too, right?</b>

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.720
I wonder what happened.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.360
I was away for the past six months on a gourmet space trip,

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:58.900
<b>so I don't know,</b>

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.040
but maybe he's another one of those missing chefs?

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.270
T-Take-chan is...

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:09.920
Komatsu!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.560
You did it, Komatsu!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.990
Congrats on making it to the final tournament.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.560
Toriko-san! Everyone!

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.020
Koma-chan...

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:27.600
You're really partners with the famous Toriko?

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:30.450
You didn't just team up for the third round here?

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.310
R-Right.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.470
I only made it this far

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.110
thanks to Toriko-san.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:38.030
As if!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:42.110
Matsu! I'd say you get 1% merit from your partnership with Toriko.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.380
1% is selling him short, Sunny.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.700
I'd go as far as 20%.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.820
Just 20%?!

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:53.900
Sorry. Maybe 22.2%?

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:55.450
That's hardly any different!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.640
Wow...

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:57.450
What's with the matching 2s?!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.560
Three of the Four Kings Gourmet Hunters...

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.560
Like good things come in pairs?!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.200
So, who's this guy?

00:07:03.140 --> 00:07:06.530
This is Ume-chan, a colleague from my training days.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.210
I-I'm Nakaume!

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:12.680
I-It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:16.530
He's the scion of the Nakaume Cooking School.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:20.480
Everything that Ume-chan makes is absolutely delicious!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.350
Aw, come on...

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.020
Huh. A chef?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.490
Speaking of the Nakaume Cooking School,

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:28.290
when we were making the Medicinal Mochi,

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.330
10,000 of the chefs

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.330
were gathered by Chef Sumire,

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.700
from that selfsame distinguished school.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.470
You own the school where Chef Sumire...

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.400
Yes.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:42.620
I've known Aunty Sumire since I was a kid.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.840
So where are you cooking now, Ume-chan?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:47.090
I-I...

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.580
Right now, I'm...

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:53.150
So this is where you were, Chef Nakaume.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.460
President Moi is looking for you.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:01.730
You'd better prepare his meal soon.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:03.900
S-Sorry!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.710
I'll be right there.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.350
Sorry, Koma-chan. I have to get going.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.740
Good luck with the tournament!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:15.500
I'll be rooting for you!

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:16.480
Ume-chan...

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.580
I apologize.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.680
Those guys are with Gourmet Tourist...

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.220
Gourmet Tourist?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.010
The global company?

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.270
Come to think of it,

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:31.360
it was an investor in the Nakaume Cooking School.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.530
And Moi is their president, right?

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.530
So your friend is working as his personal chef?

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:44.810
Ume-chan...

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:47.970
All these jerks...

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.880
Not one surprise among 'em.

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:56.180
<b>Mahmay Moi, President of Gourmet Tourist
Gourmet Billionaire</b>

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:56.180
They pose no threat to us.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.570
I'm sure Gourmet Corp. will start their war soon.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.690
<b>Colonel Mokkoi, President of Gourfill Inc.
Gourmet Billionaire</b>

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:06.120
And it's almost time for us to make our move...

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:42.810
This atmosphere... Somethin' big is gonna happen.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.510
What's wrong, Komatsu?

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:48.200
Are you afraid?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.710
O-Of course not!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.460
I'm trembling with excitement.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.510
Are you sure?

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.070
I have an announcement.

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:40.230
Would the participating chefs in the final tournament gather together?

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:42.050
Now, please.

00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:47.800
The first match is Chef Komatsu versus Chef Zaus.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:50.710
It's time, Matsu!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.490
We'll be cheering you on, Komatsu-kun.

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:53.970
Good luck!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.520
You better not lose in the first match of the final tournament!

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:00.510
In fact, don't lose 'til you take down that idiot Brunch!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.190
Anyway, I'll cook to the best of my ability.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.280
Please watch me, Toriko-san!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.520
It's here at last.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:17.160
Komatsu, I don't mean this as a joke or anything...

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:22.800
I seriously think you got a chance at winning this thing.

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:26.420
Your talent as a chef

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.290
isn't outdone by Zaus.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:29.900
Not by Brunch, either!

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.870
Toriko-san...

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:36.370
Take the title of Super Cook!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.940
I will!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.500
We'll keep a close lookout

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.470
so you can focus on the Cooking Fest

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:03.600
with peace of mind.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.000
I got a message from Zebra.

00:12:15.680 --> 00:12:16.880
They're here.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.400
Alright, let's start at last!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:43.690
The Cooking Fest's final tournament!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:13:00.990
The first match features Chef Komatsu versus Chef Zaus!

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:03.160
Good luck, Chef Komatsu!

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:04.720
You can win it!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.930
Zaus! Show 'im that he's out of his league!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:11.820
Chef Zaus has won the Fest 14 times in the past.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:13.560
So perhaps

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:16.720
this will be practice with a skilled partner

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.730
for the brave up-and-comer, Chef Komatsu!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.770
I'm glad I'm going up against you.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.110
Let's have as much fun as we can.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.430
For as long as time allows...

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:38.500
I have a feeling you'll go all out in the end.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.740
In the end?

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:45.380
Alright! The final tournament!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.140
The first match is...

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.820
<b>Darkness</b>

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:01.700
...the Darkness Cooking Duel!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.420
<b>Darkness</b>

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.460
Darkness... Cooking?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:09.880
You won't be able to see anything in the darkness,

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:13.460
so you'll have to rely on sense of smell, intuition,

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.390
and your experience as you cook.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:21.470
With dangerous ingredients and Special Preparation Ingredients

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:23.910
in the darkness,

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.780
one mistake will be fatal.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.650
Now, let's get started!

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.460
The first match of the finals!

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.090
Darkness Cooking Duel!

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.990
Ready? Go!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.900
I really can't see anything!

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.000
I'm going to cook here?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.830
Even though I don't even know where the kitchen is?

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:46.200
This is the Cooking Fest's battle...

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:58.800
Chef Zaus is already cooking?!

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.750
I'd better hurry too!

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:08.870
Scents and sounds...

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.470
And touch...

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.780
<b>That's how I'll know what the ingredients are.</b>

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.600
What's this?

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:32.140
It's warm, like human flesh...

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:34.810
No...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.310
It's not so much warm...

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:39.980
...as hot!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.340
Go!

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.320
The Giraffe Birds!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:29.130
These cloned Beasts that have been given

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.610
an enhanced sense of smell and wariness...

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.610
...are being taken down before they can cry out!

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.940
Mimicry!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.140
How many of them are there?!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:52.480
GT Robots!

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.960
They're coming by air and sea!

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:16.450
Capture every single last chef

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.440
participating in the Fest.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:21.750
Anyone stands in the way,

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:25.280
you're authorized to wipe them out!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.170
The Giraffe Birds are in carnivorous mode!

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:48.140
Oh, dear...

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:53.230
We're not off to a very good start,

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.710
but this means war!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:10.560
Star...!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:20.310
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:27.690
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:33.220
Only a smile has no flavor, so wipe your tears

00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:40.000
After a downpour of rain from the sky, the sun always rises high

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:45.480
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:51.030
My heart races and I become captivated

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:52.800
Don’t give up!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:21:00.110
<b>I’m closest to you in the middle of a challenge</b>

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:04.600
Always believe in yourself!

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:17.520
<b>Guess the Legend! The Legend Gourmet Quiz!</b>

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:17.520
Guess the Legend! The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:19.660
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.280
Now, in this segment,

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:26.160
<b>you guess the legendary ingredients of the Gourmet Age!</b>

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:36.210
<b>Really?! Level 5</b>

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:33.530
Today's "Really?!" level is 5!

00:21:34.130 --> 00:21:36.440
Someone once said...

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:39.330
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.980
Okay, okay. Here we go.

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:46.090
<b>Really?! Level 5</b>

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.090
Someone once said...

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:50.300
There are tangerines that are sweeter

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.440
and riper the deeper they're asleep...

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:55.610
Something something!

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:58.040
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.910
Start!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:14.060
<b>...tangerines</b>

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.010
Night tangerines?

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:09.900
Hint: What greeting do you give people at night?

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.410
Someone once said...

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:28.320
<b>Good Nightangerines</b>

00:22:15.840 --> 00:22:17.990
There are tangerines that are sweeter

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:20.820
and riper the deeper they're asleep...

00:22:21.290 --> 00:22:25.820
Good Nightangerines!

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:31.420
I want to eat a lot, then sleep a lot!

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:36.330
But don't you still have a lot of work to do today?

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:38.940
Life is hard.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:43.870
And now let's get back on track with our next segment!
